  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a substantial development site in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\n42 & 44 Atkin Avenue occupies approximately 1,707sqm across two freehold titles, positioned on a remarkably flat and prominent corner site in the heart of Mission Bay.\r\n\r\nWhat sets this opportunity apart is the work already completed. Resource Consent has been approved for a boutique development of 19 apartments, providing the incoming owner with the opportunity to move forward without starting the lengthy resource consent process from scratch — potentially saving significant time and holding costs.\r\n\r\nThe approved scheme comprises a well-considered mix of 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, together with 28 basement car parks. The site's level contour, generous frontage and corner position further enhance its development appeal.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the location.\r\n\r\nMission Bay Beach is within easy walking distance, along with the waterfront, cafés, restaurants, parks and everyday amenities. Auckland CBD is also conveniently accessible, giving the future development the lifestyle and location credentials that continue to make Mission Bay one of Auckland's most sought-after residential suburbs.\r\n\r\nAt a Glance\r\n• Approx. 1,707sqm across two freehold titles\r\n• Resource Consent approved for 19 apartments\r\n• 2 & 3-bedroom apartment configuration\r\n• 28 basement car parks\r\n• Exceptionally flat corner site\r\n• Walking distance to Mission Bay Beach\r\n• Excellent access to Auckland CBD\r\n• The vendor is highly motivated and committed to a sale.\r\n\r\nFor developers, investors and land bankers seeking a quality project in a premium Auckland location, this is an opportunity that warrants serious consideration.",
